Fonts by others, shipped inside Cutlass

Every file is from the Google Fonts repository,
https://github.com/google/fonts, at commit
29b4ec6df2522a8aee279414b78a07910b065874 (13 November 2026), fetched on
14 November 2026 from the folder named with each family. The files are
unchanged and keep their names. Each family's folder holds its license
text as that folder had it.

